     9	// redactSecrets removes any occurrence of the given secret values from s,
    10	// replacing each with a placeholder. Errors built from authenticated HTTP
    11	// response bodies (the OAuth token exchange, the entiredb info/refs probe) are
    12	// surfaced to the GUI over SSE and persisted in the result doc, so scrub the
    13	// credential that was in scope for that request out of the text first — a
    14	// misbehaving endpoint that echoes the token back can't then leak it.
    15	func redactSecrets(s string, secrets ...string) string {
